OL,3,GNEWSAMayor wants 'urgent' meeting over
OL,4,APost Office closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayor has called for an "urgent
OL,7,Fmeeting" with Post Office bosses after
OL,8,Fplans were announced to close the
OL,9,FPeterborough city centre branch.
OL,11,FThe branch, based inside the TG Jones
OL,12,Fstore on Bridge Street, is due to close
OL,13,Fin early 2027 as part of a
OL,14,Frestructuring plan from the retailer.
OL,16,FIn a letter to Post Office chief
OL,17,Fexecutive Neil Brocklehurst, Paul
OL,18,FBristow, the Conservative Mayor of
OL,19,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough, said
OL,20,F"there is a real concern" Peterborough
OL,21,Fcould be left without a branch.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
