OL,3,GNEWSAMayor wants 'urgent' meeting over
OL,4,APost Office closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement the Post Office said
OL,7,Falternative options were already
OL,8,Foperating in the city but that it was
OL,9,Fseeking a replacement location, warning
OL,10,Fthe process could "take around six
OL,11,Fmonths".
